OL,4,Aindustrial action
OL,5,
OL,6,FProspect national secretary for
OL,7,Faviation, David Avery, said: "While we
OL,8,Fare pleased that a resolution was
OL,9,Feventually found, it was disappointing
OL,10,Fthat members were forced to take
OL,11,Findustrial action in order to secure
OL,12,Fit."
